## 6. API Design

```
GET    /resources           → list (paginated: ?page=1&pageSize=20)
GET    /resources/:id       → single resource
POST   /resources           → create (201)
PUT    /resources/:id       → full update
PATCH  /resources/:id       → partial update
DELETE /resources/:id       → delete (204 no content)
```

Response envelope:

```json
// Collection
{ "success": true, "data": [...], "meta": { "total": 100, "page": 1, "pageSize": 20 } }

// Single
{ "success": true, "data": { ... } }

// Error
{ "success": false, "error": { "message": "...", "code": "ERROR_CODE" } }
```

